 more than ever  not at least in the digital world  the way we approach algorithms and ai  will define the world we live in  and this is why the european union  proposes  to start work on a transatlantic ai  agreement we want to set a blueprint  for regional and global standards  aligned with our values  human rights and pluralism  inclusion and the protection of privacy  a transatlantic dialogue on the  responsibility of  online platforms together  we could set the blueprint for other  democracies  facing the same challenges to make sure  that algorithms and ai are a force  for good once again  i'm delighted to be with you today i'm  deeply honored by this award thank you  very much for that and thank you very  much for having me with you today thank  you  thank you so much it's good to  have us with you we look forward to  working very closely with you  and with your

